// AuthorizeScope decides whether the actor in ctx may act in ⟦.Profile.Vocabulary.A⟧
// ⟦.Profile.Vocabulary.Name⟧, and with which permissions. gorbital does not know, so
// nothing here is implemented: fill it in and delete the error.
//
// This file is yours from the moment it landed. orb generated it once and
// will not write it again, and orb upgrade never touches it.
//
// The tables are in db/migrations/⟦.Profile.ScopeMigration⟧: ⟦.Profile.ScopeTable⟧ and
// ⟦.Profile.ScopeMembersTable⟧, with one role per member. A finished
// implementation reads the member's role for scopeID, and
//
//   - returns [gorbital.ErrScopeNotFound] when scopeID is not ⟦.Profile.Vocabulary.A⟧
