//     deleted, or exists without them — so IDs can't be probed;
//   - returns actor.ErrUnauthenticated without an actor at all;
//   - returns actor.ErrForbidden when their role doesn't grant permission;
//   - otherwise returns a context whose actor acts in the ⟦.Profile.Vocabulary.Name⟧:
//     actor.WithScope(ctx, scopeID, permissions of the role).
//
// While it returns gorbital.ErrNotImplemented every
// /v1/⟦.Profile.Vocabulary.Segment⟧/{⟦.Profile.Vocabulary.PathParam⟧}/… route refuses, authorizer_test.go fails,
// and orb doctor names this module.
